# SBR native file format for Fresnel reflection / reflection-transmission table data.
# Generated from Fresnel_Metamaterial_test project and Unit_cell design.
# The following key is critical in distinguishing between a reflection table and a reflection/transmission table, as well as between isotropic and anisotropic notations.
RTTable
# RTTBL file format version.
# RTTBLver 1.0
# The incident angle theta is measured from the vertical (Z-axis) towards the horizon (XY-plane) and must start from 0.
# Maximum simulated theta value, deg.
# ThetaMax 45.0
# The angular sampling is specified by the number of theta steps.
# <num_theta_step> = number_of_theta_points – 1
8
# theta_step is 11.25 deg.
# Frequency domain
# MultiFreq <freq_start_ghz> <freq_stop_ghz> <num_freq_steps>
MultiFreq 10.0 16.0 30
# Data section follows. Frequency loops within theta.
# <r_te_re> <r_te_im> <r_tm_re> <r_tm_im> <t_te_re> <t_te_im> <t_tm_re> <t_tm_im>
